Command: S
Effect : search for pattern
Modes  : x, x-y, x@y

Examples:
S 5 <str>    - search for <str> on the next 5 lines (including current)
S 3-10 <str> - search for <str> on lines 3 through 10 inclusive
S 6@50 <str> - search for <str> on 6 lines starting with line 50

Also see the help on strings.
